  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: When you blink your eyes back open, it is dark in the classroom, the only
      light source is the cool moonlight shining in through the window. Dazedly,
      you think that the moon seems especially bright tonight.
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 1
    text: "Shit, did I oversleep? Why didn\u2019t anyone wake me? Actually, nevermind,
      they probably thought it was funny to leave me here."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: 'You scramble up from your desk and hurriedly make your way to the dorms. '
    videoEventId: 
